{
  "id": "io.github.parieses.startup-manager",
  "name": "启动项管理",
  "version": "1.0.1",
  "description": "查看并启停本机开机启动项，覆盖注册表 Run 键与「启动」文件夹中的快捷方式。",
  "author": "QuickDock",
  "category": "系统工具",
  "platforms": [
    "windows"
  ],
  "icon": "icon.svg",
  "backend": {
    "runtime": "native",
    "entry": "startup-manager"
  },
  "host_apis": [],
  "frontend": {
    "enabled": true,
    "entry": "frontend/index.html",
    "width": 640,
    "height": 580
  },
  "permissions": {
    "network": false,
    "filesystem": {
      "read": [
        "~/AppData/Roaming/Microsoft/Windows/Start Menu/Programs/Startup"
      ],
      "write": [
        "~/AppData/Roaming/Microsoft/Windows/Start Menu/Programs/Startup"
      ]
    },
    "process": [
      "reg"
    ]
  },
  "commands": [
    {
      "id": "startup-list",
      "title": "列出启动项",
      "keywords": [
        "startup",
        "启动项",
        "开机",
        "自启"
      ],
      "aliases": [
        "启动项管理",
        "开机启动"
      ],
      "prefix": "/startup",
      "acceptsInput": true,
      "title_i18n": {
        "zh-CN": "列出启动项",
        "en-US": "List Startup Items"
      }
    }
  ],
  "capabilities": [
    "command",
    "frontend"
  ],
  "name_i18n": {
    "zh-CN": "启动项管理",
    "en-US": "Startup Manager"
  },
  "description_i18n": {
    "zh-CN": "查看并启停注册表 Run 键与启动文件夹的开机项",
    "en-US": "List and toggle registry Run keys and Startup folder shortcuts."
  },
  "changelog": "## v1.0.1\n\n- 【顺带修一个致命 bug】列表渲染脚本少一个右括号，导致整页 JS 解析失败、插件界面完全不工作（与本次主题修复一起发布）\n- 跟随宿主浅色 / 深色主题：监听宿主的 plugin:theme 消息并同步 <html data-theme>；plugin:init 自带的 theme 也会应用。此前主程序切换主题后插件不跟随\n\n## v1.0.0\n\n- 枚举并启停注册表 Run 键与启动文件夹中的开机项"
}
